  "details": [
    {
      "summary": "Where the model stops",
      "text": "Where the model stopsIt illustrates the current promise returned just after completion publication. A later fetch or an attachment to an already-completed request streams directly. It does not update a promise execution has already captured. If the workspace is missing, the real execution path calls back into the process and waits for ACKs or grace expiry before scheduling shutdown. Follow that lifecycle crossing ↗"
    }
  ],
